{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"The Elderly Aljarad Smith shuffles through the cemetery humming to himself, his white suit is pristine but his hands and shoes are covered in dirt. He smiles when he sees Willow.","created_at":"2021-07-19T22:03:37.696000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866802488610914304","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Hello, Mr. Smith, you may not recognize me, I was that small purple woman who stood on the chair.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T22:04:16.555000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866802651597111296","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"I'm here to pick up the belongings of one Evelyn Wrask, on behalf of Johnathan Wrask.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T22:04:59.255000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866802830694547457","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Ah yes, I do recognize you miss, would you like a cup of tea? I was just coming back from searching for a specific resting place on these grounds for Mr. Wrask.\" The aged man says with a smile as he steps onto the path towards the homestead.","created_at":"2021-07-19T22:05:50.722000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866803046562791424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"No tea for me this time, I have to deliver the belongings to Mr. Wrask soon.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T22:06:41.196000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-19T22:06:52.375000Z","id":"866803258266091540","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Ah, a shame. I was hoping to show him the grave... But he'll be happy to know I did find a few things that were left behind after the funeral.\" Mr. Smith says as he begins making his way towards the house. \"Follow me, I'll get them wrapped up for you in a more convenient package.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T22:08:38.950000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866803752160460820","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
